	(text "DESIGN NOTES - TELEMETRY\nMAX-M10S retained for coast/recovery. Above 4 g,\nboost tracking may drop out. Velocity limit: 500 m/s.\nLog fix validity and IMU data; inertial position drifts.\nGPS feed: short 50-ohm route, continuous ground,\nground vias by FL2. Antenna nominal ground: 50 x 50 mm.\nKeep batteries and radio antenna away from GPS patch.\n915 MHz: 10,000 ft is a range-test target, not a guarantee.\nMount AE3 inside fiberglass; strain-relieve its cable.\nRatings and tolerances are in component properties.\nOriginal TODO reference names are retained as written."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 211 24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22c16926-b98e-4742-a841-4e0aadd01db3")
	)
	(text "TODO: \nfigure out best antenna solution for 915mhz,\nif needed, include an SMA port (undesireable)\nupdate footprints for AE1 FL1 U6 and TP1\nAdd voltages/tolerances for all capacitors/resistors\nValidate schematic against component datasheets\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.466 131.318 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
				(thickness 0.4064)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "35dc77c1-c571-4339-a112-8e6665a68027")
	)
	(text "GPS Module & LNA"
